      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm seeing all these different things online about the mail-in ballots from this last election. Some people are saying it's totally fine and others are saying it's a disaster waiting to happen. Can you just be honest with me—is the system actually reliable, or is it being manipulated?",
